drink together to celebrate our becoming friends.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_12","text":"She wanted to use alcohol for us to be more comfortable around each other and get to know each other better.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_13","text":"Thinking back on that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_14","text":"made me want to share a drink with someone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_15","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_16","text":"That's why I contacted you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_17","text":"I want to drink with you, Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_18","text":"Just the two of us?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_19","text":"Yes. No one else.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_20","text":"You want to know more about me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_21","text":"I do.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_22","text":"And I want to tell you more about me as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_23","text":"It's strange, but that's what I'm feeling right now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_24","text":"That doesn't make you uncomfortable, does it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_25","text":"Not at all. I'm all for it. Let's drink.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_26","text":"Is that really okay?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_27","text":"Sure, I'd like that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_28","text":"That's a relief.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_29","text":"I'll prepare some drinks and head over to the Commander's Room.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_30","text":"Why don't we go buy them, you and I?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_31","text":"Together, you mean?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_32","text":"Sure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_33","text":"Let's do that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_34","text":"I'll wait for you downstairs.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_35","text":"Oh, and one more thing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_36","text":"Erm... when we're out buying the drinks...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_37","text":"Could I hold your hand again?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_38","text":"Of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_39","text":"Thank you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_40","text":"I'll get ready and head out soon.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_41","text":"See you in a few minutes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_02_42","text":"See you soon.","jump":null}],"chat":true}